# --- static build -----------------------------------------------------------
# static-site/ is the FTP deploy root. Generated pages, stylesheet, script,
# .htaccess, robots.txt and sitemap.xml are TRACKED so the branch is directly
# deployable and every change is reviewable in a diff.
#
# The bulk assets below are byte-identical copies of public/ (already versioned
# in this repo), so they are ignored here rather than duplicated - that would
# add ~72 MB of redundant data to git history with no benefit.
# Re-copy them any time with:
#   robocopy public\images static-site\images /E
#   robocopy public\videos static-site\videos /E
#   robocopy public\brochures static-site\brochures /E
#   robocopy public\store-badges static-site\store-badges /E
#   copy public\kizen-logo.jpg static-site\kizen-logo.jpg
static-site/images/
static-site/videos/
static-site/brochures/
static-site/store-badges/
static-site/kizen-logo.jpg
